{"title":"Career Roadmap — Network Security Engineer","role":"Network Security Engineer","summary":"A Network Security Engineer designs, implements, monitors, and maintains security controls that protect an organization's networks, systems, applications, and data from unauthorized access and cyberattacks.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Computer Science & Engineering (Networks)"},"about":[{"label":"Dataset ID","text":"344"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Network Security Engineer designs, implements, monitors, and maintains security controls that protect an organization's networks, systems, applications, and data from unauthorized access and cyberattacks."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Computer Networks","Cybersecurity","Infrastructure","Cloud","Automation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A Network Security Engineer should understand both how networks work and how attackers attempt to compromise them."},{"type":"h","text":"Core responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design secure network architectures"},{"text":"Configure firewalls and security gateways"},{"text":"Implement network segmentation"},{"text":"Monitor network traffic"},{"text":"Investigate security incidents"},{"text":"Configure VPNs and secure remote access"},{"text":"Manage IDS/IPS"},{"text":"Secure wireless networks"},{"text":"Implement Zero Trust principles"},{"text":"Protect cloud networks"},{"text":"Perform vulnerability assessments"},{"text":"Automate network-security tasks"},{"text":"Maintain security policies and documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Architecture"},{"type":"flow","items":["Users / Devices","Switches","Routers","Firewall","IDS/IPS","Load Balancer","Applications"]},{"type":"p","text":"with security monitoring across the environment."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Pe